   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "MS. OKONKWO-HALE",
     "text": "Okay. Civics. Before the state test, the district requires that you watch this. Again.",
     "start": 26.5,
     "end": 32.19
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "Is it the one with the guy?",
     "start": 32.31,
     "end": 35.48
    },
    {
     "who": "MS. OKONKWO-HALE",
     "text": "It's always the one with the guy.",
     "start": 35.6,
     "end": 38.77
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 3,
   "shot": "3.2",
   "start": 39.19,
   "end": 67.9,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "Hi there, citizen! Ever wonder why Median is so darn special?",
     "start": 39.99,
     "end": 44.85
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "In 1871, surveyor Elias Thornbury got tired and sat down.",
     "start": 44.97,
     "end": 49.22
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "For eleven years, nobody joined him.",
     "start": 49.34,
     "end": 52.15
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "Then, in 1987, our friends at Aggregate Insights discovered that Median is exactly like America — just smaller, and with less to do!",
     "start": 52.27,
     "end": 61.2
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "And that means one super important thing:",
     "start": 61.32,
     "end": 64.49
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "What Median buys today… America buys tomorrow!",
     "start": 64.61,
     "end": 67.78
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 3,
   "shot": "3.3",
   "start": 67.9,
   "end": 75.64,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "So remember, kids: stay average, stay grateful, and never, ever—",
     "start": 67.9,
     "end": 72.15
    },
    {
     "who": "FILMSTRIP NARRATOR (V.O.)",
     "text": "—(tape warble)—go near the Cube.",
     "start": 72.27,
     "end": 74.72
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 3,
   "shot": "3.4",
   "start": 75.64,
   "end": 90.54,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Wait.",
     "start": 76.54,
     "end": 77.79
    },
    {
     "who": "MS. OKONKWO-HALE",
     "text": "Yes, Dex.",
     "start": 77.91,
     "end": 79.28
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "If Median buys something… America buys it.",
     "start": 79.4,
     "end": 82.82
    },
    {
     "who": "MS. OKONKWO-HALE",
     "text": "That's… the filmstrip, yes.",
     "start": 82.94,
     "end": 85.03
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "So if we make Median buy something—",
     "start": 85.15,
     "end": 88.32
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "—America buys it.",
     "start": 88.44,
     "end": 90.42
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 3,
   "shot": "3.5",
   "start": 90.54,
   "end": 135.32,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "That's not how that—",
     "start": 90.54,
     "end": 92.63
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "It's literally how that works. It's in the filmstrip. Point one: the filmstrip. Point two: also the filmstrip.",
     "start": 92.75,
     "end": 99.88
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "The filmstrip also says the Cube is \"a friend.\"",
     "start": 100,
     "end": 103.89
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "And it said that in 1987, Wren. Before the tape warble.",
     "start": 104.01,
     "end": 108.87
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "You guys, not me finding out I live in a literal focus group.",
     "start": 108.99,
     "end": 114.57
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "Wait, we didn't know this?",
     "start": 114.69,
     "end": 117.39
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "We watch it every year.",
     "start": 117.51,
     "end": 119.96
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "I'm usually filming during it.",
     "start": 120.08,
     "end": 122.53
    },
    {
     "who": "PA VOICE (V.O.)",
     "text": "Attention, Median. Please return your Breakfast Lasagna BrunchBars to any ValuBarn location. Do not eat them. They are not screaming. That is a known texture.",
     "start": 122.65,
     "end": 131.9
    },
    {
     "who": "TUNK",
     "text": "Mine stopped screaming.",
     "start": 132.02,
     "end": 134
    }
   ]
  },
  {
