  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.2",
   "start": 139.32,
   "end": 144.89,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Welcome… to the first day… of the rest of America.",
     "start": 139.32,
     "end": 143.57
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.3",
   "start": 144.89,
   "end": 201.88,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "Why do you have a fire extinguisher, Tunk?",
     "start": 144.89,
     "end": 148.42
    },
    {
     "who": "TUNK",
     "text": "Grandpa says carry what you'll need.",
     "start": 148.54,
     "end": 151.35
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "What do you need it for?",
     "start": 151.47,
     "end": 154.28
    },
    {
     "who": "TUNK",
     "text": "Don't know yet.",
     "start": 154.4,
     "end": 156.38
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Ideas. We need a product. Something revolutionary. Something—",
     "start": 156.5,
     "end": 160.03
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "—disruptive.",
     "start": 160.15,
     "end": 161.65
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "Ooh, what about water from a famous person's sink.",
     "start": 161.77,
     "end": 165.66
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Sourcing problem. We don't know a famous person.",
     "start": 165.78,
     "end": 169.31
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "My mom's dentist did a commercial.",
     "start": 169.43,
     "end": 172.24
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Local famous. Margins collapse.",
     "start": 172.36,
     "end": 174.45
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "A hat. For your phone. So they can't see out of the camera.",
     "start": 174.57,
     "end": 179.9
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "Who's \"they\"?",
     "start": 180.02,
     "end": 181.39
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Okay, these are all good, these are all good, but they're missing—",
     "start": 181.51,
     "end": 186.48
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "—the thing.",
     "start": 186.6,
     "end": 188.22
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "The thing is cost, Dex. Every idea costs money to make. Water costs money. Hats cost money. Cardboard costs money. The perfect product costs nothing to produce.",
     "start": 188.34,
     "end": 197.34
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "So you want to sell nothing.",
     "start": 197.46,
     "end": 200.27
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Ideally? Yeah.",
     "start": 200.39,
     "end": 201.76
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.4",
   "start": 201.88,
   "end": 209.27,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "When did you leave?",
     "start": 203.48,
     "end": 205.57
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "What's in the box?",
     "start": 205.69,
     "end": 207.78
    },
    {
     "who": "TUNK",
     "text": "Nothing.",
     "start": 207.9,
     "end": 209.15
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.5",
   "start": 209.27,
   "end": 231.35,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Say that again.",
     "start": 209.27,
     "end": 211
    },
    {
     "who": "TUNK",
     "text": "Nothing.",
     "start": 211.12,
     "end": 212.62
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "That's the product.",
     "start": 212.74,
     "end": 214.72
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "No.",
     "start": 214.84,
     "end": 216.09
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Not an empty box, Wren. A box of potential. This is what I call the Pruitt Principle—",
     "start": 216.21,
     "end": 222.98
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "What number?",
     "start": 223.1,
     "end": 224.47
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Forty.",
     "start": 224.59,
     "end": 226.09
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "There were never one through thirty-nine.",
     "start": 226.21,
     "end": 229.02
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Not with that attitude.",
     "start": 229.14,
     "end": 231.23
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.6",
   "start": 231.35,
   "end": 272.32,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Production cost: zero. Shipping weight: basically zero. Margin…",
     "start": 231.35,
     "end": 234.88
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Infinite. You guys, it's infinite margin. I've only ever read about this.",
     "start": 235,
     "end": 240.22
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "What do we call it?",
     "start": 240.34,
     "end": 242.79
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "VOID.",
     "start": 242.91,
     "end": 244.16
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "VOID is literally such a good name.",
     "start": 244.28,
     "end": 247.7
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "I named it.",
     "start": 247.82,
     "end": 249.55
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "I just said it. Out loud. In front of everyone.",
     "start": 249.67,
     "end": 253.92
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "I thought it first.",
     "start": 254.04,
     "end": 256.13
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "You can't own a thought, Dex.",
     "start": 256.25,
     "end": 259.06
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "And you can't own nothing! Which is why it's perfect.",
     "start": 259.18,
     "end": 263.68
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "Can I ask a question? If we're selling nothing… what happens when someone opens it?",
     "start": 263.8,
     "end": 270.1
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "They film it.",
     "start": 270.22,
     "end": 272.2
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.7",
   "start": 272.32,
   "end": 284.94,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "I want it on the record that I said no.",
     "start": 272.32,
     "end": 276.57
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Noted.",
     "start": 276.69,
     "end": 277.94
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "Marcus, we need eight hundred boxes.",
     "start": 278.06,
     "end": 281.12
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "I'll need a loan.",
     "start": 281.24,
     "end": 283.33
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "From who?",
     "start": 283.45,
     "end": 284.82
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 4,
   "shot": "4.8",
   "start": 284.94,
   "end": 291.2,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "Tunk, where did you get—",
     "start": 284.94,
     "end": 287.39
    },
