  },
  {
   "sc": 5,
   "shot": "5.1",
   "start": 291.2,
   "end": 301.21,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "Okay, you guys. Okay. VOID. Okay. Unboxing it for the first time. Literally shaking.",
     "start": 291.2,
     "end": 297.14
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "It's… literally nothing.",
     "start": 297.26,
     "end": 298.99
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "It's giving… minimal?",
     "start": 299.11,
     "end": 301.09
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 5,
   "shot": "5.2",
   "start": 301.21,
   "end": 303.21,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "sc": 5,
   "shot": "5.3",
   "start": 303.21,
   "end": 315.78,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "Sold: zero. We've sold zero units of zero.",
     "start": 303.21,
     "end": 306.74
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "It's a slow build. All great products are slow builds. The wheel—",
     "start": 306.86,
     "end": 311.83
    },
    {
     "who": "WREN",
     "text": "Don't.",
     "start": 311.95,
     "end": 313.45
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "—was a slow build.",
     "start": 313.57,
     "end": 315.66
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 5,
   "shot": "5.4",
   "start": 315.78,
   "end": 349.64,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "Guys. Guys. What if this is… bad.",
     "start": 315.78,
     "end": 318.95
    },
    {
     "who": "MARCUS",
     "text": "It is bad. Commercially. That's the problem.",
     "start": 319.07,
     "end": 322.24
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "No — like, bad. Think about it. Point one: you can't see inside it before you buy it. Point two: there's nothing in it. Point three: who benefits when there's nothing?",
     "start": 322.36,
     "end": 331.36
    },
    {
     "who": "DEX",
     "text": "…Us?",
     "start": 331.48,
     "end": 332.73
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "I'm just saying. If VOID was nothing, why would they not want you to have it?",
     "start": 332.85,
     "end": 339.51
    },
    {
     "who": "KENZIE",
     "text": "Gordy, that's my live—",
     "start": 339.63,
     "end": 341.72
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "They don't want you to have it.",
     "start": 341.84,
     "end": 345.26
    },
    {
     "who": "GORDY",
     "text": "I'm not saying it's connected. I'm saying it's adjacent.",
     "start": 345.38,
     "end": 349.52
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sc": 5,
   "shot": "5.5",
   "start": 349.64,
   "end": 352.64,
